    simili: ["ingresso-onore-fiera-pesaro","bocciodromo-pesaro","architettura-residenziale"],
    en: {"titolo":"Santa Veneranda residential district","luogo":"Santa Veneranda, Pesaro","tag":["Residential","District","Artistic direction"],"intervento":"Design, site supervision and artistic direction of the Celletta di Santa Veneranda residential district","progettisti":["Client and builder: Impresa Mulazzani S.p.A."],"testo":"<p>Designing the residential district of the Celletta di Santa Veneranda in Pesaro, built by Impresa Mulazzani S.p.A., was a great professional experience that kept me busy every day for many years, in the design, the site supervision and the artistic direction of the whole complex.</p><p>From a first block of 50 terraced houses I moved on to restyling an original scheme by the engineer Torri and the architects Angelini and Battimelli — five tower buildings linked by two commercial blocks — redesigning the layout and furnishing of every flat and all the façades, including the eight-pitched star-shaped roof with exposed beams.</p><p>A special mention goes to the eighth and ninth floors of each tower, where four two-storey apartments form a penthouse with a breathtaking view over the city and the sea on the horizon.</p>"},
