    en: {"titolo":"Children’s Theatre","luogo":"Viale Trieste, Pesaro","tag":["Open-air theatre","Public garden","Design option"],"intervento":"Proposal for an open-air theatre in the public garden on Viale Trieste","progettisti":["With the architect Massimo D’Agnillo"],"testo":"<p>The Children’s Theatre on Viale Trieste in Pesaro grew out of my dream of giving order to a public garden that has hosted children’s performances for years, and where a summer tent theatre once stood, with many famous actors on its stage.</p><p>The architect Massimo D’Agnillo worked with me on the design. The idea has not yet found the attention and funding needed to build it.</p>"},
